            <div xml:id="d617">

                <pb facs="0742" n="657" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg657"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.001W64/93: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gunther</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-12-07T13:00:00+00:19"><hi rendition="#italic">December 7,
                                1919, 1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 5.07
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>7047. The Minister for Foreign Affairs confided to me the demand for the
                    “extradition” of the ex-Kaiser was about to be made and he asked me if I also
                    knew this and I replied that I did not.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gunther</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
